#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Native radio services for the desktop. Android remains the only radio owner.

Presents Android's Wi-Fi and mobile data as NetworkManager (plus ModemManager
for signal and operator), Bluetooth as BlueZ, and airplane mode on a small
private interface, so GNOME's own panels and quick settings work unchanged.

No passwords are persisted or logged here. No Linux routes or DHCP are changed.
"""
